  "createdAt" : 1539204241,
  "description" : "<strong>A. SUMMARY</strong>\nThis dataset contains all street intersections in the City of San Francisco. It includes the street names and types that intersect at each point. \n\nStreet nodes can have one or street names associated with it. This dataset contains one row for every street at each node.\n\n<strong>B. HOW THE DATASET IS CREATED</strong>\nThis dataset is created by extracting data from the City's geographic information system (SFGIS).\n\n<strong>C. UPDATE PROCESS</strong>\nThis dataset is updated daily to reflect changes to the City's street network.\n\n<strong>D. HOW TO USE THIS DATASET</strong>\nGroup on CNN to get a list of all distinct intersections in San Francisco.\n\n<strong>E. RELATED DATASETS</strong>\n<u><a href=\"https://data.sf.gov/d/3psu-pn9h\">Streets - Active and Retired</a></u><br><u><a href=\"https://data.sf.gov/d/vd6w-dq8r\">Street Nodes</a></u>",
